Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 480
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 24

Type "cd ~/Desktop/codemap/demo-repo"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "codemap ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms

Type "codemap --cross ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms

Type "codemap --search Engine ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms

Type "codemap --incremental ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms
